What is Auto Scaling Group (ASG)
✅ Auto Scaling Group automatically adds or removes instances based on demand, ensuring your application is always available.
✅ It helps scale up when more capacity is needed and scale down during low usage to optimize costs, keeping the right number of servers running at all times.
Functions of ASG:
 🔹 Automatic scaling based on demand
 🔹 Maintaining instance health
 🔹 Implementing scaling policies
 🔹 Ensuring high availability
 🔹 Scheduled scaling
 🔹 Cost optimization
